{{!--
    The homepage hero.

    A stated hero band — kicker, one large line, a lede, two actions — and then
    the lead post beneath it as a wide framed piece of media. The two are
    deliberately different jobs: the band says what this publication is, the
    post shows what it currently looks like.

    Which post fills the slot is the homepage_lead setting.

    Two Ghost constraints shaped this file, and both fail silently:

    1. {{#match}} must be used as a block. As a subexpression it returns a
       SafeString object rather than a boolean, and an object is always truthy,
       so {{#unless (match a "b")}} can never fire.

    2. {{#get}} does not resolve async helpers inside its {{else}} branch, so a
       second {{#get}} nested there renders nothing at all with no error. The
       "featured, or the latest if nothing is featured" fallback is therefore an
       ordering on one query rather than two nested ones.
--}}
<section class="ghost-hero">
    <div class="ghost-container ghost-hero__inner">

        {{!-- A short label above the title. Optional, and hidden when unset —
             there is no sensible default for it, and inventing one would put
             words on a publisher's homepage that they never wrote. --}}
        {{#if @custom.homepage_kicker}}
            <p class="ghost-hero__kicker">
                <span class="ghost-hero__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                {{@custom.homepage_kicker}}
            </p>
        {{/if}}

        {{!-- The site title is the headline. It is the one string every
             publication has, it is short by nature, and it is what a first-time
             visitor needs to read first. --}}
        <h1 class="ghost-hero__title">{{@site.title}}</h1>

        {{!-- The lede: the homepage_intro setting, or the site description. --}}
        {{#if @custom.homepage_intro}}
            <p class="ghost-hero__lede">{{@custom.homepage_intro}}</p>
        {{else}}
            {{#if @site.description}}
                <p class="ghost-hero__lede">{{@site.description}}</p>
            {{/if}}
        {{/if}}

        <div class="ghost-hero__actions">
            <a class="ghost-button ghost-button--primary" href="#latest">
                Start reading {{> "icon" name="arrow-right"}}
            </a>
            {{#if @site.members_enabled}}
                {{#unless @member}}
                    <a class="ghost-button ghost-button--outline" href="#/portal/signup">Subscribe</a>
                {{/unless}}
            {{/if}}
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

{{#match @custom.homepage_lead "None"}}{{else}}
<section class="ghost-lead">
    <div class="ghost-container">
        {{#match @custom.homepage_lead "Featured Post"}}
            {{#get "posts" limit="1" order="featured desc, published_at desc" include="authors,tags" as |leadPosts|}}
                {{#foreach leadPosts}}{{> "lead-post"}}{{/foreach}}
            {{/get}}
        {{else}}
            {{#get "posts" limit="1" order="published_at desc" include="authors,tags" as |leadPosts|}}
                {{#foreach leadPosts}}{{> "lead-post"}}{{/foreach}}
            {{/get}}
        {{/match}}
    </div>
</section>
{{/match}}
